### Cadastrar Funcionário
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "João Silva",
  "email": "joao@logistica.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}


### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@logistica.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}

### Cadastrar Motorista
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos Souza",
  "cnh": "12345678901",
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "telefone": "47999999999"
}

### Listar Motoristas
GET http://localhost:3000/motorista

### Consultar Motorista por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/motorista/1

### Consultar Motorista por Nome
GET http://localhost:3000/motorista/nome/Carlos Souza

### Atualizar Motorista
PUT http://localhost:3000/motorista/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "telefone": "47988888888"
}

### Deletar Motorista
DELETE http://localhost:3000/motorista/1

### Cadastrar Carga
POST http://localhost:3000/carga
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Carga de eletrodomésticos",
  "peso": 250.50,
  "volume": 18.75,
  "codigoRastreio": "ABC123456",
  "codMotorista": 1
}

### Cadastrar Entrega
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codEntrega": 1,
  "destino": "Florianópolis",
  "status": "TRANSITO",
  "data": "2026-10-27",
  "hora": "08:30:00",
  "codCarga": 1
}
